WEBVTT

02:08.560 --> 02:10.240
It's quite lively at the Ye Residence now.

02:10.320 --> 02:12.080
Why are you out here alone?

02:12.160 --> 02:13.160
They're having fun,

02:14.640 --> 02:16.120
but it has nothing much to do with me.

02:16.200 --> 02:17.160
Do you want to drink?

02:17.760 --> 02:18.720
What do you mean?

02:21.200 --> 02:23.120
To help you find the courage
to talk to me.

02:23.200 --> 02:25.840
I'm afraid you'll stand up
and leave mid-sentence.

02:26.320 --> 02:29.160
Even if I do stand up and leave,

02:30.360 --> 02:31.480
can't you finish my sentence?

02:33.280 --> 02:36.480
Duke Su, how did you investigate
your cases in the past?

02:36.960 --> 02:38.600
Don't always make me put up an act

02:39.320 --> 02:40.840
before you make a confession.

02:41.520 --> 02:43.560
In the interrogation chambers
of Duke Mansion,

02:43.640 --> 02:45.080
you didn't get to interrogate me.

02:46.040 --> 02:46.920
You can do it today.

02:47.880 --> 02:49.400
You have a sharp memory.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.200
Ask me anything.

02:53.200 --> 02:56.280
No one tells the truth
without a little pressure.

02:56.360 --> 02:57.440
If that's the case,

02:58.920 --> 03:00.960
will you be accusing me

03:01.560 --> 03:03.560
of threatening a noble lady in the future?

03:03.640 --> 03:05.400
You can argue with me any day,

03:07.200 --> 03:08.800
but can you be lenient with me today?

03:08.880 --> 03:10.160
What's your surname?

03:10.240 --> 03:11.240
Ask me another question.

03:11.320 --> 03:13.520
- No, this is my rule.
- I don't have a surname then.

03:13.600 --> 03:14.920
- What's your name?
- I have no name.

03:15.000 --> 03:15.880
Where are you from?

03:15.960 --> 03:18.600
I'm a restless spirit
from the Qingcheng Mountain.

03:21.760 --> 03:23.120
I am not Jiang Li.

03:24.080 --> 03:24.920
I know.

03:26.320 --> 03:27.480
You are just

03:29.120 --> 03:30.280
a little civet.

03:30.360 --> 03:31.480
I've known you for so long

03:32.440 --> 03:33.880
and you're still so unserious.

03:33.960 --> 03:35.360
That makes me more annoying, right?

03:37.120 --> 03:38.000
Duke Su,

03:39.640 --> 03:40.680
you really

03:41.480 --> 03:42.360
are eccentric.

03:42.440 --> 03:44.440
I don't care what people think about me

03:44.960 --> 03:46.280
or how they criticize me.

03:48.080 --> 03:50.880
Annoying people live long.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.280
Smile.

03:58.160 --> 04:00.640
You took Tong Zhiyang down.
You should smile.

04:04.480 --> 04:06.280
I'll treat you to steamed buns today.

04:06.360 --> 04:09.240
The wrapper is white and fluffy
with a fresh and tender filling.

04:09.320 --> 04:13.160
Mouthwatering with a delicious aroma.

04:22.960 --> 04:24.120
Duke Su,

04:24.200 --> 04:27.120
do you think people only cherish

04:27.200 --> 04:28.440
the things that they have lost?

04:28.520 --> 04:29.960
Only fools do that.

04:30.040 --> 04:31.520
I'm probably a fool then.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.640
The moon is so beautiful tonight.

05:10.080 --> 05:11.040
You are not a fool.

05:12.320 --> 05:14.520
You never trampled on someone's life.

05:14.600 --> 05:16.560
No matter how many regrets you have now,

05:16.640 --> 05:18.520
you're worthy of your past and future.

05:20.040 --> 05:22.480
That's why you dared to return
and find out what happened

05:22.560 --> 05:23.960
then move forward to seek justice.

05:24.040 --> 05:28.000
Suddenly being all serious
makes you look pretentious.

05:28.080 --> 05:28.960
It doesn't matter.

05:29.560 --> 05:30.640
After today,

05:30.720 --> 05:32.240
I'm once again despised by everyone.

05:34.640 --> 05:36.160
The city of Luyang is so nice.

05:36.760 --> 05:39.720
But it's late. The night duty is coming.

05:41.440 --> 05:42.560
Go home then.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.200
That's not my home.

05:49.360 --> 05:50.200
Li.

05:52.280 --> 05:53.800
For prisoners,

05:53.880 --> 05:55.360
it's important to verify identity.

05:56.160 --> 05:59.840
But humans don't need
to seek clarity in everything.

06:00.560 --> 06:02.320
The lights are on in Luyang now.

06:03.600 --> 06:05.400
If you were a restless spirit,

06:05.480 --> 06:07.280
you would've long been reduced to ashes.

06:12.120 --> 06:13.360
I will live on well.

06:27.880 --> 06:30.520
YE RESIDENCE

07:26.000 --> 07:27.160
You're so handsome.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.160
Duke Su,

08:02.240 --> 08:05.160
do you think people only cherish

08:05.640 --> 08:07.000
the things that they have lost?

08:07.480 --> 08:08.880
For prisoners,

08:08.960 --> 08:10.320
it's important to verify identity.

08:11.600 --> 08:15.080
But humans don't need
to seek clarity in everything.

08:15.680 --> 08:17.440
The lights are on in Luyang now.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.600
If you were a restless spirit,

08:19.680 --> 08:21.520
you would've long been reduced to ashes.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.080
Home?

08:44.200 --> 08:45.640
I no longer have a home.

09:11.560 --> 09:13.800
Miss, the servant just sent a message.

09:13.880 --> 09:16.240
A woman would like you to visit her home.

09:16.320 --> 09:18.240
- Who is it?
- Qiong Zhi.

09:20.280 --> 09:21.120
Qiong Zhi?

09:24.160 --> 09:26.240
- It's the blusher shop in the south.
- Really?

09:26.320 --> 09:27.280
It looks good.

09:28.760 --> 09:29.880
This color is nice.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.120
That color is particularly pretty.

09:33.200 --> 09:34.480
I must try it then.

09:37.280 --> 09:40.520
- It's almost done drying, right?
- Are you here to see Ms. Qiong Zhi?

09:40.600 --> 09:41.760
Yes.

09:41.840 --> 09:43.200
Her medicine is cooking.

09:43.280 --> 09:44.920
Let her drink it later.

09:45.000 --> 09:47.560
May I ask what disease
Qiong Zhi is down with?

09:55.360 --> 09:57.320
Tong'er, wait for me here.

10:35.680 --> 10:36.640
Qiong Zhi.

10:38.560 --> 10:39.680
Qiong Zhi.

10:49.000 --> 10:50.240
Ms. Jiang.

10:52.160 --> 10:53.360
The water is over there.

10:54.760 --> 10:55.760
Help yourself.

10:57.520 --> 10:58.680
What happened to you?

10:59.400 --> 11:01.000
I wanted to find you as soon as possible.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.480
I didn't expect

11:07.440 --> 11:08.520
that I couldn't get up.

11:10.240 --> 11:11.600
Is there any news?

11:21.160 --> 11:22.760
Ms. Jiang, you're a person of nobility,

11:24.000 --> 11:25.680
but you are not from the Xue family.

11:26.680 --> 11:27.800
Knowing so many things

11:31.400 --> 11:33.040
is all just entertainment for you.

11:33.560 --> 11:34.840
Without the word nobility,

11:36.520 --> 11:37.560
if it is as you said

11:38.960 --> 11:40.480
that I see human life as entertainment,

11:41.280 --> 11:42.720
then I shouldn't even be a person.

11:43.280 --> 11:44.200
Why bother?

11:45.880 --> 11:47.960
This murder case happened long ago.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.320
When the gavel came down,

11:52.600 --> 11:53.520
those who should die

11:54.640 --> 11:56.640
and those who shouldn't were all dead.

11:57.760 --> 11:59.320
Should this case be overturned,

11:59.880 --> 12:01.680
all the dark and filthy will resurface.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.920
Your luxurious clothing

12:07.200 --> 12:08.360
will get dirty too.

12:08.840 --> 12:10.400
In this world,

12:12.240 --> 12:15.600
there has to be someone who dares
to return and find out what happened,

12:17.360 --> 12:18.720
then move forward to seek justice.

12:18.800 --> 12:19.720
Magistrate Xue

12:22.440 --> 12:23.600
is not dead.

12:32.400 --> 12:33.240
Really?

12:34.280 --> 12:35.120
A few days ago,

12:37.080 --> 12:39.480
some officials from Huaixiang
came to Xihua Brothel.

12:41.320 --> 12:43.360
Cui Zhu? Where is Cui Zhu?

12:44.120 --> 12:45.240
- Magistrate Feng.
- Cui Zhu.

12:46.840 --> 12:49.320
Magistrate Feng, you're late.

12:49.960 --> 12:50.920
Well…

12:51.000 --> 12:52.760
- Let Cui Zhu come out.
- Cui Zhu…

12:53.320 --> 12:55.320
Cui Zhu is feeling unwell today.

12:55.400 --> 12:57.400
We have three new ladies here.

12:57.480 --> 12:59.040
They are all pretty good.

12:59.120 --> 13:02.400
Ning Lian, Yu'er, hurry.

13:03.320 --> 13:05.480
- Coming!
- Magistrate Feng. Come.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.280
Get away from me.

13:08.360 --> 13:10.480
We only want Cui Zhu today.

13:10.960 --> 13:14.200
- These people already came once before.
- Cui Zhu!

13:15.160 --> 13:16.920
Cui Zhu hosted them.

13:17.680 --> 13:19.480
They paid handsomely,

13:19.560 --> 13:20.560
but…

13:37.840 --> 13:41.520
According to Cui Zhu,
as those three were drunk,

13:42.280 --> 13:43.200
they…

13:46.440 --> 13:47.560
What are you doing?

13:47.640 --> 13:50.040
What are you doing? Let me go.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.040
Let go!

13:53.520 --> 13:56.040
Cui Zhu, did you miss me?

13:56.120 --> 13:58.040
Please don't, Magistrate Feng.

14:00.680 --> 14:01.880
Let me go!

14:03.560 --> 14:05.680
Please, Magistrate Feng.

14:06.320 --> 14:07.800
Let me go!

14:07.880 --> 14:10.560
Let me go!

14:10.640 --> 14:11.840
- Let me go!
- Don't move.

14:13.680 --> 14:15.360
I beg you.

14:15.440 --> 14:17.000
Let me go!

14:19.200 --> 14:20.440
No!

14:21.160 --> 14:22.000
Cui Zhu.

14:29.720 --> 14:30.600
Cui Zhu.

14:33.480 --> 14:35.280
Don't touch me!

14:35.360 --> 14:36.680
It's me. Cui Zhu.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.240
These animals.

14:53.280 --> 14:55.440
- I'll report this to officials.
- Don't.

14:56.360 --> 14:57.560
Don't, Qiong Zhi.

14:57.640 --> 15:00.840
I still need this money
to treat my mother's illness.

15:00.920 --> 15:01.760
Don't go.

15:15.720 --> 15:18.840
Two days ago, those three came again.

15:18.920 --> 15:19.840
Drink one more

15:19.920 --> 15:21.320
Everyone didn't dare to host them.

15:22.640 --> 15:24.120
The madam asked us to draw lots.

15:24.760 --> 15:28.120
Just draw it. Think of it
as earning money for your family.

15:33.400 --> 15:34.280
I'll go.

16:11.200 --> 16:13.160
After Magistrate Xue was put on death row,

16:13.760 --> 16:15.000
he wasn't executed immediately.

16:15.560 --> 16:17.360
The execution is six months later.

16:18.160 --> 16:20.960
But now, it's almost time
for his execution.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.760
That was all I could get

16:24.320 --> 16:25.240
from them.

16:38.720 --> 16:39.600
It's all right.

16:45.240 --> 16:47.120
It's just that my cheap life

16:47.200 --> 16:49.440
wouldn't be able to wait
until the day justice is served.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.040
That day will come.

16:53.840 --> 16:54.760
You have to wait

16:55.760 --> 16:57.440
and see for yourself

16:59.760 --> 17:01.800
what ending awaits those men.

17:01.880 --> 17:02.960
Qiong Zhi,

17:03.920 --> 17:07.240
I will return to Huaixiang
to seek justice for you

17:07.319 --> 17:08.680
and overturn the Xue family's case.

17:09.760 --> 17:12.880
I want to personally capture
those lowly beasts,

17:12.960 --> 17:14.480
peel their skin,

17:14.560 --> 17:15.560
and drink their blood.

17:16.240 --> 17:17.440
I swear to you.

17:18.680 --> 17:19.520
Just wait.

17:20.240 --> 17:21.960
You must live well.

17:31.560 --> 17:36.000
The Xue family is fortunate
to have a friend like you.

17:46.040 --> 17:47.160
Ms. Jiang,

17:49.640 --> 17:52.320
do you remember the drawing in this box?

17:52.800 --> 17:55.160
Xue Zhao is not an ignorant
and incompetent fool.

17:55.640 --> 17:59.160
This drawing is not
some leisurely doodles.

17:59.720 --> 18:01.360
It's just that I am not smart enough

18:01.440 --> 18:03.280
to figure out what he left me.

18:05.320 --> 18:07.280
ENTRANCE, TOP CAVE ENTRANCE,
MINING AREA

18:07.360 --> 18:08.680
I'll leave Xue Zhao's last work

18:12.160 --> 18:13.400
to you.

18:14.040 --> 18:15.120
Solve it.

18:21.680 --> 18:23.400
Wait, Qiong Zhi.

18:23.480 --> 18:24.480
I'll get the physician.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.840
Jiang Li,

18:29.640 --> 18:33.240
I know my condition well.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.840
When I first arrived at Xihua Brothel,

18:46.240 --> 18:50.680
I sought death countless times,
but to no avail.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.960
Now, I know

18:56.360 --> 18:58.280
the heavens kept me alive…

19:04.560 --> 19:05.880
to await your arrival.

19:19.720 --> 19:20.560
Jiang Li,

19:21.400 --> 19:25.760
you must remember what you promised.

19:27.760 --> 19:29.600
Seek justice

19:31.560 --> 19:33.080
for people like us.

19:39.360 --> 19:41.200
All right. I'll get you your medicine.

20:00.160 --> 20:01.080
Xue Zhao.

20:04.840 --> 20:06.600
I'm coming to you.

20:20.240 --> 20:25.240
ZHAO

20:35.720 --> 20:36.640
Qiong Zhi.

20:43.440 --> 20:44.920
Qiong Zhi.

21:01.720 --> 21:03.960
ZHAO

21:32.600 --> 21:34.680
Duke Su, I asked the house owner.

21:35.320 --> 21:36.760
Chu Lan's rent is paid annually

21:37.520 --> 21:38.520
in gold.

21:38.600 --> 21:39.480
Gold bars?

21:39.560 --> 21:41.080
If so, an investigation would be easier.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.720
They're not gold bars
cast by the imperial court,

21:43.440 --> 21:44.320
but scrap gold.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.720
Payment in grains of gold?

21:45.800 --> 21:48.640
There seems to be a gold mine around.

21:48.720 --> 21:49.640
That can't be.

21:49.720 --> 21:51.240
Due to land disasters in the south
two years ago,

21:51.320 --> 21:52.560
the imperial court closed down all mines.

21:52.640 --> 21:54.640
Luyang's mining ban has yet to be lifted.

21:54.720 --> 21:56.640
There can't be any gold mines around.

21:57.320 --> 21:58.840
The imperial mine is closed…

22:00.000 --> 22:02.040
Private mines? My goodness.

22:02.680 --> 22:04.520
Privately mining imperial gold mines

22:04.600 --> 22:06.120
is as guilty as treason.

22:06.200 --> 22:07.720
But we don't know where the mine is.

22:07.800 --> 22:08.800
They can't hide it.

22:09.360 --> 22:11.160
They won't have much manpower

22:11.240 --> 22:13.040
and mines that can be accessed immediately

22:13.120 --> 22:15.440
are mostly open-pit, sand gold mines.

22:15.520 --> 22:16.560
Wen Ji,

22:17.200 --> 22:20.760
look along the downstream
closed imperial mines.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.280
Yes.

22:49.600 --> 22:50.480
Jiang Li,

22:50.560 --> 22:52.760
I picked out some fine satin for you.

22:53.360 --> 22:54.280
Jiang Li!

22:55.720 --> 22:57.520
Li'er, come eat some melon seeds.

22:58.080 --> 22:58.960
Li'er!

23:02.960 --> 23:06.240
Jiang Li, this pot of flowers
is as beautiful as you are.

23:06.320 --> 23:08.640
I'll put it in your room.
Would you like that?

23:31.280 --> 23:32.280
- Where is she?
- Where is she?

23:38.200 --> 23:39.760
Nothing serious happened, right?

23:40.800 --> 23:43.240
She wouldn't do anything stupid
like you did last time, right?

23:44.000 --> 23:46.880
Hang herself, bump into the wall,
or jump into a lake?

23:46.960 --> 23:47.800
How scary.

23:48.280 --> 23:51.240
This won't do.
We have to get someone to check on her.

23:53.080 --> 23:54.640
Wait. Why are you all looking at me?

23:55.360 --> 23:57.680
I'm not good with words.
I don't know how to comfort people.

23:59.320 --> 24:01.320
Then let's do the usual. Draw lots.

24:05.560 --> 24:08.600
Jiang Li, where are you going
with your luggage?

24:08.680 --> 24:10.120
I have important things to do.

24:10.840 --> 24:12.720
What exactly is it? Tell me.

24:12.800 --> 24:14.120
Come on. What's happening to you?

24:14.200 --> 24:15.280
Let me leave.

24:15.840 --> 24:16.680
Hold on, Jiang Li.

24:17.200 --> 24:18.800
Seeing you so distracted today,

24:18.880 --> 24:20.080
I knew something had happened.

24:20.840 --> 24:21.840
Tell me.

24:21.920 --> 24:23.640
There is strength in numbers.

24:33.320 --> 24:34.760
When I was at Zhennv Hall,

24:37.360 --> 24:38.760
I met a young lady.

24:40.840 --> 24:41.840
If not for her,

24:43.080 --> 24:44.280
I wouldn't be alive.

24:46.240 --> 24:47.480
Later on, she died of illness.

24:48.280 --> 24:49.880
Before she died, she told me

24:49.960 --> 24:52.880
her father used to be
the magistrate of Huaixiang.

24:53.400 --> 24:55.640
He was framed and died
in an unpleasant way.

24:57.480 --> 24:58.640
She was stuck in Zhennv Hall,

24:59.120 --> 25:00.520
unable to hold her father's funeral.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.960
She said that if I go back someday,

25:04.440 --> 25:06.760
I must help her place some flowers
on her father's grave.

25:07.920 --> 25:11.360
This way, both of them
can meet again in the next life.

25:13.360 --> 25:14.880
Later on, I sent someone to ask around

25:15.560 --> 25:19.200
and found out today
that her father is not dead.

25:19.720 --> 25:21.840
Instead, he is imprisoned
in Huaixiang's prison.

25:23.640 --> 25:25.600
Do you want to look
into her father's case?

25:30.040 --> 25:30.920
Jia'er,

25:31.960 --> 25:34.240
do you think I shouldn't meddle in this?

25:35.320 --> 25:38.360
The Jiang Li I know wouldn't ask me
if she should or not.

25:39.360 --> 25:40.680
She will stand up

25:40.760 --> 25:42.120
for anything that is just.

25:42.920 --> 25:45.160
Tell me when you are going.
I'll go with you.

25:45.240 --> 25:46.920
I'll pack my things right away.

25:47.000 --> 25:50.040
Jia'er, Uncle Mingxuan just came home.

25:50.760 --> 25:53.200
You're still handling
the faltered business.

25:53.280 --> 25:54.280
You have to stay here.

25:55.840 --> 25:56.880
I'll go to Huaixiang

25:58.320 --> 25:59.240
on my own.

25:59.320 --> 26:01.360
Can you not treat me like an outsider?

26:01.960 --> 26:03.600
It's all right if it was somewhere else.

26:03.680 --> 26:04.640
But Huaixiang…

26:06.720 --> 26:07.560
makes me worry.

26:08.680 --> 26:09.800
What do you mean?

26:09.880 --> 26:12.200
Our family used to have
a store in Huaixiang.

26:13.520 --> 26:15.040
After the new magistrate took office…

26:16.800 --> 26:17.640
Tax inspection!

26:18.120 --> 26:20.320
Your store didn't pay anything
for occupancy tax last month.

26:20.400 --> 26:21.240
What's the matter?

26:21.320 --> 26:22.880
Does the Ye family wish to rebel

26:22.960 --> 26:24.160
in the Huaixiang territory?

26:24.240 --> 26:25.080
Sir,

26:25.160 --> 26:27.920
our occupancy and passing taxes
were all paid together.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.960
Well, we still have
the tax receipts that you gave to us.

26:31.040 --> 26:32.760
Hold on, sir. I'll get it for you now.

26:34.280 --> 26:35.680
How dare you forge tax receipts?

26:35.760 --> 26:37.960
It seems like you'd like us
to cuff you up today, right?

26:38.040 --> 26:39.360
Come. Cuff him and take him away.

26:40.560 --> 26:44.600
Sir!

26:44.680 --> 26:46.000
I'll pay those taxes right now.

26:47.120 --> 26:48.960
It was such a calm, peaceful region,

26:49.040 --> 26:51.880
but now it's all rotten and corrupted.

26:52.600 --> 26:54.920
That was why our business couldn't go on.

26:55.520 --> 26:56.800
We withdrew the business.

26:56.880 --> 26:58.920
Now that you're going there,

26:59.000 --> 27:01.040
I must accompany you no matter what.

27:01.120 --> 27:03.600
Jia'er shouldn't go either. I'll go.

27:04.080 --> 27:06.520
Uncle Mingyu, how can you eavesdrop on us?

27:06.600 --> 27:08.160
If I weren't eavesdropping,

27:08.640 --> 27:10.440
I wouldn't even know

27:10.520 --> 27:13.280
that one dares to go alone and the other
is following to cause trouble.

27:14.600 --> 27:17.040
Do not underestimate me. I'm going.

27:17.120 --> 27:18.920
You'd better just stay at home.

27:19.000 --> 27:20.920
Although I couldn't keep my escort agency,

27:21.440 --> 27:23.640
my escort skills are still sound.

27:23.720 --> 27:25.360
I can protect Jiang Li,

27:25.440 --> 27:26.800
but if you're going too

27:27.360 --> 27:28.240
and something happens,

27:28.720 --> 27:30.440
- who should I save?
- You…

27:30.520 --> 27:31.560
Jia'er,

27:32.160 --> 27:33.240
you should stay here.

27:33.760 --> 27:34.760
I don't know

27:34.840 --> 27:38.240
how to explain properly this
to Uncle Mingxuan and Aunt Zhuo.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.400
You have to help me.

27:40.480 --> 27:43.040
All right. Leave the family to me.

27:43.120 --> 27:45.520
If you need anything there, just tell me.

27:45.600 --> 27:47.880
Huaixiang is not far away.
I'll go help at once.

27:48.560 --> 27:49.400
All right.

27:50.520 --> 27:51.800
Then let me say thank you first.

28:07.600 --> 28:08.840
We found it, my lord.

28:08.920 --> 28:10.280
Sure enough, it's a sand gold mine.

28:10.360 --> 28:12.200
I walked down the waterway
in East Mountain

28:12.280 --> 28:14.080
and saw it within three miles of walking.

28:14.760 --> 28:15.960
Is it not secluded at all?

28:16.680 --> 28:17.840
Not really.

28:17.920 --> 28:20.440
They are working in the name
of mining soil and sand.

28:21.000 --> 28:23.400
During the day, it seemed
to be just digging soil and sand.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.600
But the worksheds are cleverly designed.

28:25.680 --> 28:27.360
They were scattered along the river.

28:27.440 --> 28:28.800
The very first workshed

28:28.880 --> 28:30.680
is right next
to the sealed imperial gold mine.

28:30.760 --> 28:31.960
Guess what?

28:32.520 --> 28:33.920
The mine cave is open.

28:34.000 --> 28:36.440
So they are not just digging for sand gold

28:36.520 --> 28:38.000
but also mining imperial gold mines.

28:38.880 --> 28:40.120
But that's impossible.

28:40.200 --> 28:43.240
Forget about open-pit mining
of sand gold, but to open up new mines…

28:44.200 --> 28:45.440
Do they have that many laborers?

28:45.520 --> 28:47.280
Where is the imperial gold mine?

28:47.760 --> 28:48.800
In Huaixiang.

28:48.880 --> 28:49.960
Huaixiang?

28:50.040 --> 28:50.960
Are you surprised?

28:51.040 --> 28:53.080
Xue Huaiyuan,
who was jailed for corruption,

28:53.160 --> 28:54.520
used to be the magistrate there.

28:54.600 --> 28:55.560
What a coincidence.

28:56.720 --> 28:58.400
When was the soil and sand mine built?

28:58.480 --> 29:00.760
About half a year ago.

29:03.200 --> 29:06.840
Six months ago,
Xue Huaiyuan was imprisoned

29:08.120 --> 29:09.760
and the sand mine was built.

29:10.440 --> 29:13.560
Are you saying this has something
to do with the Xue family?

29:13.640 --> 29:15.600
They can mine sand gold themselves.

29:16.360 --> 29:17.880
But those in the capital can't reach

29:17.960 --> 29:20.240
the Huaixiang local government office

29:21.440 --> 29:23.040
to mine the sealed imperial gold mine

29:23.120 --> 29:24.720
in the territorial borders of Huaixiang.

29:24.800 --> 29:26.080
What's so difficult about that?

29:26.160 --> 29:27.640
If they can't reach it, just buy them off.

29:28.200 --> 29:29.560
Didn't that darn governor of Luyang

29:29.640 --> 29:31.240
suck up to them so much?

29:31.320 --> 29:32.920
What if they can't buy him off?

29:33.000 --> 29:33.920
Then just…

29:35.040 --> 29:36.320
Do you mean

29:36.400 --> 29:38.400
Li Zhongnan framed Xue Huaiyuan
to embezzle

29:39.000 --> 29:40.760
from the imperial gold mine?

29:40.840 --> 29:42.720
I'm afraid the deaths
of Xue Fangfei and Xue Zhao

29:43.360 --> 29:45.880
were not solely caused
by offending Wanning.

29:45.960 --> 29:47.600
They were afraid that Xue Huaiyuan

29:47.680 --> 29:49.160
would tell his children about this,

29:50.200 --> 29:51.880
so they silenced both of them.

29:53.160 --> 29:55.280
It seems like I need to go to Huaixiang.

29:55.360 --> 29:56.240
My lord,

29:56.720 --> 29:58.560
you're suddenly going to Huaixiang.

29:59.040 --> 30:00.560
Do you need to inform Ms. Jiang first?

30:02.720 --> 30:04.400
Must I report my whereabouts to anyone?

30:10.880 --> 30:12.240
But it's actually fine to tell her.

30:15.480 --> 30:19.200
HUAIXIANG

30:31.840 --> 30:33.000
Pity us.

30:33.080 --> 30:34.080
Give us some food.

30:34.760 --> 30:35.600
Do a good deed.

30:50.720 --> 30:51.640
LU'S FRUIT PRESERVES

30:55.000 --> 30:57.720
FOR RENT, COME IN FOR FURTHER INQUIRIES

30:58.800 --> 31:00.920
Father, I want to eat this.

31:01.000 --> 31:02.800
Dried fruit preserves!

31:02.880 --> 31:03.760
Sure.

31:05.720 --> 31:06.800
Fragrance sachets!

31:06.880 --> 31:08.080
- Pick one.
- Sir.

31:08.600 --> 31:10.520
- See what you want.
- Which one looks better?

31:10.600 --> 31:11.560
I want to eat this.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.560
You want this one?

31:13.640 --> 31:14.640
HUAIXIANG PRIVATE SCHOOL

31:14.720 --> 31:15.560
All right.

31:16.040 --> 31:17.040
- I'll--
- I want this one.

31:17.120 --> 31:19.240
- I want one!
- I want one!

31:19.320 --> 31:21.080
Kids, come back!

31:21.160 --> 31:22.120
Come back to class!

31:22.600 --> 31:23.480
Kids.

31:23.560 --> 31:24.560
Listen to the teacher.

31:24.640 --> 31:25.920
Go back to class now.

31:26.000 --> 31:26.840
After class,

31:26.920 --> 31:28.680
I will buy you treats, all right?

31:28.760 --> 31:29.920
- All right!
- All right.

31:30.000 --> 31:32.040
- All right. Go.
- Thank you, Mr. Xue.

31:32.120 --> 31:33.360
Time for class!

31:33.440 --> 31:34.680
Time for class!

31:34.760 --> 31:36.080
Eat sweets after school.

31:37.320 --> 31:38.200
Come back.

31:39.600 --> 31:40.440
Come on.

31:40.520 --> 31:41.560
Time for class.

31:42.280 --> 31:43.120
Hurry up.

31:46.120 --> 31:49.600
LI RESIDENCE

31:49.680 --> 31:51.000
Go! Stay away!

31:56.840 --> 31:57.880
What happened to Huaixiang

31:59.120 --> 32:00.280
in the past six months?

32:09.880 --> 32:13.080
SIFANG GUEST HOUSE

32:13.160 --> 32:14.240
Let's stay here.

32:15.960 --> 32:18.520
Place your bets!

32:21.520 --> 32:23.920
Come on, one, two, three! Six, small!

32:30.560 --> 32:31.400
Sir!

32:31.480 --> 32:32.760
- Coming.
- Sir.

32:35.720 --> 32:36.800
Isn't this a guest house?

32:37.280 --> 32:38.720
Why is it like a gambler's den?

32:38.800 --> 32:39.800
Outsider,

32:39.880 --> 32:41.080
you'd better not say that.

32:41.640 --> 32:43.640
These bookmakers are all
from the government office.

32:50.000 --> 32:51.240
Place your bets!

32:51.800 --> 32:53.240
Eleven, big!

32:54.040 --> 32:55.320
I'm done here!

32:57.840 --> 33:00.080
- Don't go.
- Where are you going? Continue playing.

33:00.160 --> 33:02.600
I'm out of money. I really have no money.

33:02.680 --> 33:03.920
Don't you have a house deed?

33:04.000 --> 33:05.280
You can mortgage it.

33:05.360 --> 33:07.000
No money? What are you doing here then?

33:07.080 --> 33:08.240
You have no money?

33:09.360 --> 33:10.520
You can't do anything.

33:10.600 --> 33:11.760
This happens every day.

33:11.840 --> 33:13.000
Can you meddle daily?

33:17.480 --> 33:19.880
Fine. I want two rooms.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.240
That would be ten taels.

33:21.800 --> 33:22.920
Ten taels?

33:23.000 --> 33:24.760
Why don't you just rob people?

33:24.840 --> 33:26.800
I have to pay 70% to the officials.

33:26.880 --> 33:29.880
Otherwise, I can't even run my business.

33:30.440 --> 33:31.280
I…

33:31.760 --> 33:32.960
I…

33:36.360 --> 33:37.200
Let's go.

33:38.320 --> 33:39.280
I know a place.

33:40.720 --> 33:42.920
We can surely find somewhere quieter.

34:03.080 --> 34:04.680
Look at these kids running.

34:07.720 --> 34:09.920
How fresh this is. Bring some home.

34:10.000 --> 34:13.120
Is there a guest house here?

34:13.199 --> 34:14.320
Uncle Mingyu,

34:15.120 --> 34:17.679
the courtyard across the bridge
should be empty.

34:17.760 --> 34:18.840
Go and ask them.

34:18.920 --> 34:20.480
See if we can stay there for a while.

34:20.560 --> 34:21.880
How did you know that?

34:22.880 --> 34:23.719
I'm just guessing.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.840
Come on, Shun.

34:38.679 --> 34:40.639
SEALED BY HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

34:40.719 --> 34:42.840
ON MARCH, TWELFTH YEAR OF HONGXIAO

34:45.239 --> 34:47.360
Ms. Xue, I got this gift for you.

34:50.280 --> 34:52.280
It's my heartfelt sentiment.
Please accept it.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.040
All right.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.240
You're peeping again.

35:05.000 --> 35:05.880
Shut up.

35:05.960 --> 35:08.160
I have to see which boy

35:08.240 --> 35:09.520
Xue Li fancies.

35:10.080 --> 35:12.280
I've watched Xue Li grow up
since she was a child.

35:12.360 --> 35:14.200
Now and then,

35:14.280 --> 35:15.680
people are coming to propose to her,

35:16.680 --> 35:18.200
yet Xue Li rejects all of them.

35:18.280 --> 35:21.200
- What kind of a person does she like?
- Is that your business?

35:24.920 --> 35:25.880
Madam Chunfang.

35:26.440 --> 35:27.280
Xue Li.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.800
Thank you, Xue Li.

35:48.120 --> 35:49.240
Madam,

35:49.320 --> 35:51.200
may I ask why this residence is sealed?

35:53.000 --> 35:54.360
I have no ill intentions.

35:54.440 --> 35:56.720
I only want to ask
about Magistrate Xue and his family…

36:00.320 --> 36:01.160
Get in now.

36:14.400 --> 36:15.840
You guessed correctly.

36:15.920 --> 36:17.920
There is a spare room to stay up ahead.

36:18.000 --> 36:19.600
Shun, go and clean up first.

36:19.680 --> 36:20.560
Yes, my lady.

36:21.040 --> 36:23.040
Unload all the luggage from the boat.

36:23.120 --> 36:24.120
- All right.
- Go.

36:25.080 --> 36:26.400
Let's go to the government office.

36:26.480 --> 36:27.720
Why are we going there?

36:27.800 --> 36:30.080
The Huaixiang today
is completely different from what I…

36:32.360 --> 36:34.120
Different from what my friend described.

36:35.480 --> 36:36.960
A problem has its root cause.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.040
I'd like to see

36:39.600 --> 36:41.040
what kind of person

36:41.120 --> 36:42.520
is governing here.

36:42.600 --> 36:44.880
But if we go to the government office
right after we arrive,

36:44.960 --> 36:45.920
won't that alert them?

36:48.840 --> 36:50.400
I must trouble you then.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.680
Place your bets now!

36:55.920 --> 36:57.080
Go away!

36:58.760 --> 36:59.600
Who is this?

37:01.080 --> 37:02.680
You're such an eyesore here.

37:03.280 --> 37:04.200
Sir,

37:04.760 --> 37:06.240
everyone can place their bets.

37:06.320 --> 37:08.880
Why are you meddling with their affairs?

37:08.960 --> 37:11.520
I'll bet more than him.

37:12.680 --> 37:13.840
Come on! Come and bet!

37:13.920 --> 37:15.040
- Place your bet!
- Quiet!

37:15.640 --> 37:16.560
Watch and learn.

37:23.840 --> 37:25.480
You're looking for trouble!

37:25.560 --> 37:27.520
Come at me, tough guy.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.000
Take him down!

38:10.760 --> 38:12.960
Look, you broke so many things

38:13.600 --> 38:15.360
and hurt so many of my men.

38:15.440 --> 38:17.160
Take him back and punish him well!

38:17.240 --> 38:20.640
HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

38:40.080 --> 38:42.400
How can that old drum
still make any sound?

38:42.960 --> 38:45.120
Who's that? He keeps hitting it.

38:45.200 --> 38:46.120
FENG YUTANG

38:46.200 --> 38:47.600
He disturbed my sleep.

38:48.840 --> 38:49.960
Hold him down first

38:51.240 --> 38:52.480
and give him 20 floggings.

38:56.920 --> 39:01.000
PEOPLE'S SAFETY BRINGS BENEFITS

39:14.280 --> 39:15.840
Isn't this Xue…

39:15.920 --> 39:16.920
Magistrate Feng,

39:17.000 --> 39:19.440
I'm the daughter of the Chief Secretariat
and Grand Preceptor,

39:19.520 --> 39:20.440
Jiang Li.

39:24.320 --> 39:26.680
You are obviously the daughter
of a convicted official.

39:26.760 --> 39:29.480
How dare you pretend to be
an imperial court official's daughter?

39:29.560 --> 39:31.680
Guards, arrest her.

39:31.760 --> 39:32.840
How presumptuous!

39:34.880 --> 39:36.280
If you dare to touch me,

39:37.120 --> 39:38.720
you will die.

39:39.760 --> 39:41.640
Magistrate Feng,
you'd better think it through.

39:41.720 --> 39:42.920
You are betting your life

39:43.000 --> 39:44.400
with me today.

39:44.960 --> 39:47.240
You have no qualms
about torturing ordinary, powerless women.

39:47.320 --> 39:49.680
But if you dare slander the daughter
of the Chief Secretariat,

39:49.760 --> 39:52.080
you'll die without a grave to your name.

39:56.080 --> 39:57.680
Are you really--

39:57.760 --> 40:00.040
I don't know who you think I am,

40:01.360 --> 40:03.520
but my father is the Chief Secretariat.

40:04.080 --> 40:05.320
If any harm comes my way,

40:05.920 --> 40:08.360
the entire Huaixiang will pay.

40:09.960 --> 40:12.400
That'll be the end
for a seventh-rank official like you too.

40:12.480 --> 40:15.240
I didn't know people
could look alike to this extent.

40:15.320 --> 40:17.080
Pardon my ignorance.

40:17.160 --> 40:18.920
Please forgive me, Ms. Jiang Li.

40:19.000 --> 40:22.120
May I know why you are here?

40:22.200 --> 40:23.760
Can I help you in any way?

40:23.840 --> 40:24.960
You detained my people.

40:25.040 --> 40:26.200
What happened?

40:26.280 --> 40:28.320
It's that guy who caused trouble
in the gambling den.

40:30.600 --> 40:32.720
Gambling den?

40:32.800 --> 40:34.760
- Magistrate.
- Gambling den?

40:35.360 --> 40:37.040
We don't have brothels and gambling dens.

40:37.520 --> 40:39.200
Huaixiang is an honest place.

40:40.760 --> 40:43.520
The one who caused trouble
at the guest house.

40:44.120 --> 40:45.360
I know of that person.

40:46.200 --> 40:48.080
He is quite overbearing.

40:48.160 --> 40:49.760
He destroyed the entire guest house.

40:50.320 --> 40:53.240
But since you came to get him,

40:53.960 --> 40:55.120
we have to hand him over.

40:55.200 --> 40:56.440
For sure.

40:56.520 --> 40:58.160
But since he destroyed the guest house,

40:58.840 --> 41:00.200
it'd be a little too unreasonable

41:00.280 --> 41:02.080
if there's no form of compensation.

41:02.160 --> 41:03.280
So…

41:03.360 --> 41:04.280
Tong'er.

41:06.200 --> 41:08.720
I didn't expect you to be
so considerate of your people.

41:09.920 --> 41:11.560
- You really are a good official.
- Take it.

41:11.640 --> 41:12.480
I have to.

41:12.960 --> 41:14.680
As the local magistrate,

41:14.760 --> 41:16.120
all I worry about every day

41:16.200 --> 41:17.480
is the affairs of the people.

41:20.880 --> 41:22.160
Go and let him out.

41:25.000 --> 41:27.080
Since you're visiting Huaixiang,

41:27.160 --> 41:28.880
why did you not tell me in advance?

41:29.360 --> 41:31.720
Our place is small.
Sorry for not entertaining you well.

41:31.800 --> 41:32.680
How about this?

41:32.760 --> 41:35.000
What are your plans next?

41:35.080 --> 41:36.360
I can cover all the expenses.

41:36.440 --> 41:37.480
No need for that.

41:38.200 --> 41:40.520
I came to learn to do business
from my uncle.

41:41.080 --> 41:42.400
I didn't ask for my father's help,

41:42.480 --> 41:44.800
so there is no need for you
to make arrangements for me.

41:45.360 --> 41:46.520
Great. That's great.

41:47.120 --> 41:49.120
You're a person of nobility,

41:49.200 --> 41:50.600
yet you keep improving yourself.

41:50.680 --> 41:52.400
You are a role model to all of us.

41:53.440 --> 41:54.280
What about you guys?

41:54.840 --> 41:55.680
Come here.

41:56.520 --> 41:58.120
Look at your way of making money!

42:00.600 --> 42:02.040
These are all new officers

42:02.760 --> 42:04.080
who need straightening out.

42:11.760 --> 42:12.640
Magistrate.

42:18.240 --> 42:20.040
Ms. Jiang Li, I'm so sorry.

42:20.120 --> 42:21.920
People who work in the government office

42:22.000 --> 42:23.760
are rash.

42:23.840 --> 42:25.440
Don't you use your head?

42:25.520 --> 42:27.560
It just so happens that I am new here,

42:27.640 --> 42:28.960
so I can't control them well.

42:29.040 --> 42:30.160
Well…

42:31.400 --> 42:32.280
Uncle Mingyu,

42:32.840 --> 42:35.040
since it's all right now,
we'd better get going.

42:36.120 --> 42:37.280
Thank you, Magistrate Feng.

42:41.120 --> 42:42.200
Hold on.

42:51.360 --> 42:53.680
Ms. Jiang Li, if you need any help,

42:53.760 --> 42:55.840
tell me at once.

42:56.320 --> 42:58.560
I will take care of it for you.

42:58.640 --> 42:59.520
Thank you.

43:12.040 --> 43:13.600
Keep a tight eye on them for me.

43:19.320 --> 43:20.920
People who work in the government office

43:21.000 --> 43:22.760
are rash.

43:22.840 --> 43:24.200
Don't you use your head?

43:25.280 --> 43:26.280
In the past six months,

43:27.440 --> 43:29.000
one of their greatest pleasures

43:29.520 --> 43:30.960
was to torture Magistrate Xue.

43:37.120 --> 43:38.920
Why don't you watch where you're going?

43:39.000 --> 43:40.680
Are you all right, ma'am?

46:33.840 --> 46:38.840
Subtitle translation by:
